# Island always live

When SPIRION island UI ships (Library, Capture, Home, Analyses, Enrichment, Settings, AppShell):

- Commit those product files (user said **immer live**).
- Push `main` via SSH `git@github.com:chbrdk/design-intelligence-graph.git` without changing `origin`.
- Coolify-deploy **only** `coolify.digAppUuid` (`dig-v3:main-app`). Do **not** deploy the API unless asked — an API restart drops the in-memory capture queue.
- After deploy: hard-reload the island. Token: `/tmp/dig-coolify.token`. Details: `knowledge/coolify-dig-staging.md`.

MCP example pages stay local HTML under `tmp/` (see local-html-demos rule).
